      {
        "key": "B",
        "content": "Linear",
        "rationale": "A linear sequence has constant **first** differences."
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "content": "Exponential",
        "rationale": "An exponential sequence has a constant **ratio** between terms."
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "content": "Cubic",
        "rationale": "A cubic sequence has constant **third** differences."
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Linear sequences ($an + b$) have constant first differences. Quadratic sequences ($an^2 + bn + c$) have constant second differences, equal to $2a$.",
    "hints": [
